#: ../../tools/mirna_tools.rst:66 9a826117ba3c4b7d9338482a45adf329
msgid ""
"**Description**: Retrieve publications associated with a microRNA from "
"RNAcentral. Returns publication titles, authors, PubMed IDs, DOIs, and "
"journal information. miR-21-5p (URS000039ED8D) has 344+ publications, "
"making it one of the most-studied miRNAs. Use after "
"miRBase\\_search\\_mirna to get the RNAcentral ID, then retrieve "
"associated literature."
msgstr ""

